    {
      "id": "2122516403425013981",
      "text": "After three quarters, the Heat lead, 101-81. Giannis Antetokounmpo has 20 points, 13 rebounds, six assists and three blocks. Heat have made 16 of their 35 3s tonight (45.7%).",
      "url": "https://x.com/eric_nehm/status/2122516403425013981",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:25:19+00:00",
      "likes": 11,
      "author": "Eric Nehm",
