      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1442694428460830729/jnXAS0kJ_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122516185279599088",
      "text": "That was Davion Mitchell's first in-game dunk since the 2022-23 season as a member of the Sacramento Kings.",
      "url": "https://x.com/Anthony_Chiang/status/2122516185279599088",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:24:27+00:00",
      "likes": 51,
      "author": "Anthony Chiang",
      "handle": "Anthony_Chiang",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1651934635327201280/xcmLY79A_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "End of third quarter: Heat 101, Rockets 81. Giannis up to 20 points, 13 rebounds and 6 assists. Bam Adebayo has not played in the second half due to hip tightness.",
      "quoted_author": "Anthony Chiang",
      "quoted_handle": "Anthony_Chiang"
    },
    {
      "id": "2122516067625152978",
      "text": "That would have been the best pass of the season, but Bobby Portis missed the corner 3. Giannis Antetokounmpo is just playing with 'em.",
      "url": "https://x.com/eric_nehm/status/2122516067625152978",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:23:59+00:00",
      "likes": 13,
      "author": "Eric Nehm",
      "handle": "eric_nehm",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1442694428460830729/jnXAS0kJ_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "The Rockets just don't have the bigs to deal with Giannis Antetokounmpo and he's just dominating this game. They send help, he finds the open man. They play him in single coverage, he makes a post move and finishes through contact.",
      "quoted_author": "Eric Nehm",
      "quoted_handle": "eric_nehm"
    },
